    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 19, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "自从做了那个噩梦之后，艾玛的身体状况持续恶化，<br>\n不得不卧床休息了好几天。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv03_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 21, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不明原因的低烧一直没有退去。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv03_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 23, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "虽然大部分时间都被迫在医务室或牢房的床上度过，<br>\n但她似乎没法老实地躺着，<br>\n总是一有机会就偷偷溜到监牢外面。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0103Adv03_Narrative003"]}},
